  "prefLabel": "Per-A 101.03 Proceedings Included",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per-A 101.03 Proceedings Included. Pursuant to RSA 21-I: 46, the personnel appeals board shall hear and decide appeals as provided by RSA 21-I: 57 and 21-I: 58, appeals of decisions arising out of application of the rules adopted by the director of personnel, and appeals as specified in RSA 21-I: 52 arising out of an alleged conflict of interest.\n\nSource. #9203, eff 10-23-08",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/per-a100-200.html"
